# @name checkSpot
GET {{base_url}}/events/{{eventId}}/check-spot
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# @name makeReservation
POST {{base_url}}/events/{{eventId}}/reserve-spot
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ticket_kind": "full",
  "userType": "client"
}

###
# @name getReservations
